    <name>Endurance L05A - Z2 45 min @ 68%</name>
    <description>Endurance - level 5 of 10, variant A. Z2 45 min @ 68%.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 45 min @ 68%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Solid Zone 2. You should still be able to speak in full sentences.

Estimated TSS: 42.</description>
